MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5529473217588846155}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d5fe19e1d619a2d4ba89eeb31c1d6bf2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GreatShard
  regionEvent: region1_complete
  roomObject: R1_Room08
  togetherDistance: 2.5
  glow: {fileID: 2783138768350935304}
  bobHeight: 0.12
  leaveAfter: 2.5
  pedestals:
  - {fileID: 2076541462136188582}
  - {fileID: 729183936726412251}
  holdSeconds: 3
  healedSprite: {fileID: 0}
  map: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 00a6bae52bfbc5a44a367dc96dfeb438, type: 2}
  lessons:
  - 'Nothing moves until a force makes it. Balanced forces: no change at all.'
  - "The same push moves a lighter thing faster: a = F \xF7 m."
  - 'Two pushes together add up: the net force is what counts.'
  - "An impulse becomes momentum: J = \u0394p. Enough of it breaks a wall."
  - Friction takes momentum away, a little every second.
  - "Weight is a force, W = m\xB7g. Balance it, and you can lift each other."
  - The heavier and the faster, the harder it is to stop.
  - Gravity gives every mass the same speed; the heavier cart brings more momentum.
    Together, you woke the heart of the forest.
  closing: '"You did what I never could alone.

    The forest is breathing again.
    Come home, you two."

    <size=70%>- Wren</size>'
